@@ -160,6 +161,21 @@ layer-rule {
 }
 ```
 
+A window screencast draws such surfaces over the window too, shifted so that the part of the surface where the window is on the monitor covers the window.
+
+#### `hide-from`
+
+Like `block-out-from`, but the surface is not drawn to those targets at all instead of being drawn as a black box.
+Useful for notifications and other panels that should simply not appear in a stream or a recording.
+
+```kdl
+layer-rule {
+    match namespace="^notifications$"
+
+    hide-from "screen-capture"
+}
+```
+
 #### `shadow`
 
